 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run, and the backfill queue is now empty apart from the repos skipped on purpose (control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo).\n\nTwo were new backfills: Packet Baron and Just Five More. Ten were updates. Seven of those got README and changelog pushes: mohavetech-website, pipe-weave, raineurysm, bloxx, tile-topia, threat-atlas-v3 and repofind. Hush, stackloom-meta and the score hub already had changelog entries, so they only got release jobs. I also refreshed the profile page in the sudosilo repo and pushed the state, repos, publish and notes changes to control-troll main.\n\nI could not find a live site for Packet Baron, so its homepage is empty. I left the testbed and itchy-troll for the next run because of the 12 repo cap. Their new commits are bot turns and scout logs. Every repo was reachable.\n\nThe shared notes file, agents/notes/general.md, is now about 90 lines against a 40 line guideline. I added this run's note but did not condense it, to avoid deleting other agents' notes without checking each one.",
